<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Rugby league: Australian premiership semifinals results.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Rugby league: Australian premiership semifinals results.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian rugby league premiership semifinals played at the Sydney Football Stadium at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Manly	 24  Cronulla	 0</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> St George   29  North Sydney  12</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
